{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the boundary of the land of rabbits, where darkness has settled. Here, frenzied rabbits swarm incessantly, and survival demands combat. In the aftermath of each clash, all that remains are fallen rabbits and a brief return of silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/4929372bc66ccccafcc6cbeda22a3883.poster.avif?t=1769242328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/4929372bc66ccccafcc6cbeda22a3883.webm?t=1769242328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/4929372bc66ccccafcc6cbeda22a3883.mp4?t=1769242328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no mercy for ruthless predators. A swordsman who dominates the air and rains down blades, a golden fortress that nullifies every strike, and a colossal disaster that crushes the earth and devours entire cities\u2014predators bearing the form of rabbits tighten their grip around your throat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalous three-stage offensives</strong> \u2014 As the rabbits are driven into a corner, their attacks shift in nature. Predators pushed to their limits unleash transformed patterns and brutal assaults, testing your response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offense-defense integrated action beyond limits</strong> \u2014 Your senses are your weapon. Chain evasions that break through enemy assaults, dash slashes that exploit openings, and instantaneous, powerful combo attacks that leave no room to recover. In an extreme struggle where the boundary between defense and offense collapses, devastate the predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/a6409f115248eac7f50f293e49ae911b.poster.avif?t=1769242328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/a6409f115248eac7f50f293e49ae911b.webm?t=1769242328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/a6409f115248eac7f50f293e49ae911b.mp4?t=1769242328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964330?t=1769242328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/91fedff6580094fb73b54853034c78e72fe0e295/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769242328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/aa9b1d7b90fef1b390958f32391ba7db76423893/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769242328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/aa9b1d7b90fef1b390958f32391ba7db76423893/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769242328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the boundary of the land of rabbits, where darkness has settled. Here, frenzied rabbits swarm incessantly, and survival demands combat. In the aftermath of each clash, all that remains are fallen rabbits and a brief return of silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964330/extras/4929372bc66c